жете.","sub":"","prompt":"Вы не расслышали слово.","options":["I don't understand.","Can you repeat that?","Please."],"answer":"Can you repeat that?","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"choice","title":"Выберите, что вы скажете.","sub":"","prompt":"Вы опоздали.","options":["Sorry.","Again.","Thanks."],"answer":"Sorry.","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"I don't","after":".","answers":["understand"],"bank":["understand","answer","repeat"],"why":"Скажите это, когда слово вам незнакомо.","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"Answer the","after":".","answers":["question"],"bank":["question","partner","please"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"Ask your","after":".","answers":["partner"],"bank":["partner","question","again"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"phrases","title":"Послушайте два предложения.","sub":"Запомните каждое целиком, как одну фразу.","items":[{"text":"I like coffee.","src":null},{"text":"I don't like Mondays.","src":null}]},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"note","title":"I like / I don't like","sub":"","html":"<table class=\"cp-table\"><tr><th>Лицо</th><th>Утверждение</th><th>Отрицание</th></tr><tr><td>I</td><td>I like tea.</td><td>I don't like tea.</td></tr><tr><td>I</td><td>I like music.</td><td>I don't like music.</td></tr><tr><td>You</td><td>You like coffee.</td><td>You don't like coffee.</td></tr></table><p>Используйте <b>like</b> + предмет: I like tea.</p><p>Для «нет» ставьте <b>don't</b> перед <b>like</b>: I don't like tea.</p><p><b>Don't</b> — краткая форма <b>do not</b>. В речи говорят <b>don't</b>.</p><p class=\"cp-note__fwd\">he и she будут в уроке 13.</p>"},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"note","title":"Смотрите и слушайте.","sub":"","html":"","examples":["I like coffee.","I don't like Mondays.","I like music.","I don't like rain.","Pizza is my favourite food.","I like my English class."]},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"phrases","title":"Послушайте инструкции.","sub":"Вы будете слышать их на каждом уроке.","items":[{"text":"Listen.","src":null},{"text":"Look at the picture.","src":null},{"text":"Match the words.","src":null},{"text":"Complete the sentence.","src":null}]},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"note","title":"Инструкции","sub":"","html":"<table class=\"cp-table\"><tr><th></th><th>Вы слышите</th><th>Вы делаете</th></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>Listen.</td><td>listen to the audio</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>Repeat.</td><td>say the word</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>Match the words.</td><td>join two things</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>Answer the question.</td><td>give your answer</td></tr></table><p>Инструкция начинается с глагола: <b>Listen.</b> <b>Repeat.</b></p><p>Слова <b>you</b> в ней нет.</p><p>Одна инструкция = одно действие.</p>"},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное предложение.","sub":"","prompt":"","options":["I like music.","I don't like music."],"answer":"I like music.","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное предложение.","sub":"","prompt":"","options":["I like rain.","I don't like rain."],"answer":"I don't like rain.","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное предложение.","sub":"","prompt":"","options":["I don't like cats.","I like cats."],"answer":"I like cats.","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"I","after":"coffee.","answers":["like"],"bank":["like","don't like"],"why":"Для «да» — like.","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"I","after":"Mondays.","answers":["don't like"],"bank":["like","don't like"],"why":"Для «нет» — don't like.","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"Pizza is my","after":"food.","answers":["favourite"],"bank":["like","don't like","favourite"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"order","title":"Расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["music.","I","like"],"answer":"I like music.","why":""},{"stage":"Practice","type":"order","title":"Расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["I","rain.","like","don't"],"answer":"I don't like rain.","why":""},{"stage":"Practice","type":"order","title":"Расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["Tea","drink.","is","my","favourite"],"answer":"Tea is my favourite drink.","why":""},{"stage":"Practice","type":"mistake","title":"Найдите ошибку.","sub":"Нажмите на неправильное слово.","tokens":["I","no","like","Mondays."],"bad":1,"answer":"I don't like Mondays.","why":"Для «нет» используем don't, а не no."},{"stage":"Practice","type":"mistake","title":"Найдите ошибку.","sub":"Нажмите на неправильное слово.","tokens":["I","don't","likes","coffee."],"bad":2,"answer":"I don't like coffee.","why":"После don't у глагола нет -s."},{"stage":"Practice","type":"mistake","title":"Найдите ошибку.","sub":"Нажмите на неправильное слово.","tokens":["I","am","like","music."],"bad":1,"answer":"I like music.","why":"Like работает без am: I like music."},{"stage":"Practice","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"","after":"to the words.","answers":["Listen"],"bank":["Look at","Listen","Match"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"","after":"the picture.","answers":["Look at"],"bank":["Repeat","Look at","Answer"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"","after":"the words and the pictures.","answers":["Match"],"bank":["Ask","Complete","Match"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","ty